    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right, so acid reflux is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with dyspepsia possibly related to anti-inflammatory tablets at this stage.",
